cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Synesis: A DSL compiler for knowledge engineering"
abstract: >
  Synesis is a domain-specific language (DSL) and compiler for qualitative research
  annotation. It transforms structured annotations in .syn files into canonical knowledge
  structures exportable as JSON, CSV, Excel, and Neo4j knowledge graphs. The ecosystem
  includes a Language Server Protocol (LSP) implementation, a VSCode extension, an
  LLM-assisted annotation tool (synesis-coder), a Zotero export plugin, and a
  graph database integration layer.
authors:
